option.SHADOW_FILTER_MODE=Shadow Filter Mode
option.SHADOW_FILTER_MODE.comment=Both modes preserve per-texel tint and water boundaries. The active overworld budget uses per-corner software comparison; this selection applies with the budget off or in other dimensions. Depth and tint corners stay paired. Performance depends on the GPU.
