option.ENTITY_SHADOWS=Entity Shadow Casters
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment=Entity, player and block-entity shadow casters. Off in Performance, on in Balanced and Fine; visible models and counts are unchanged.
option.BLOOM_QUALITY=Bloom Sampling Quality
option.BLOOM_QUALITY.comment=Capture reads 4 / 5 / 13 scene colours per pixel. Balanced approximates the blur with a centre and four axial samples; high uses a centre plus twelve disc samples. Lower qualities may lose small bright sources. The active overworld budget uses 4 capture reads at every quality; raw choices apply with the budget off or in other dimensions. Threshold, source ceiling and four mip levels remain; underwater follows the same rule.
value.BLOOM_QUALITY.0=Low (4 reads)
value.BLOOM_QUALITY.1=Balanced (5 reads)
value.BLOOM_QUALITY.2=High (13 reads)
option.VOLUME_FOG_ADAPTIVE=Adaptive Volume Fog Sampling
option.VOLUME_FOG_ADAPTIVE.comment=Short rays use fewer steps, concentrated near the camera. Balanced uses at most 4 / 12 / 24 steps over 32 / 96 / 192 blocks. Distant narrow shafts may be coarser. Off restores the chosen quality's fixed count and uniform spacing. Overworld volume only.
option.PURKINJE_STRENGTH=Night Blue Shift
option.PURKINJE_STRENGTH.comment=Optional blue shift in dark overworld nights, protecting bright local lights. Default 0; quality changes preserve this colour option. Excludes underwater, Nether and End.
