option.CLOUD_TEMPORAL=Cloud History Smoothing
option.CLOUD_TEMPORAL.comment=Cloud history independent of scene TAA. High keeps four fixed current-frame rays and limits opacity lag; high spatial anti-aliasing remains when history is off. Lower tiers keep multi-frame sampling.
option.sunPathRotation=Sun and Moon Path Tilt
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Solar and lunar path tilt in degrees. Default -40. Sky day and night parameters follow the selected path.
